  {"text":"QUEUE HERE","translation":"줄 서는 곳","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/elements/stanchions.js"},
  {"text":"BELT-EAST","translation":"동부 벨트","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/elements/station.js"},
  {"text":"Window 3","translation":"3번 창구","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/scene.json title"},
  {"text":"An electronic queue at the asteroid belt. Nobody here is in a hurry. Except you.","translation":"소행성대의 전자 대기열. 여기선 아무도 서두르지 않는다. 당신만 빼고.","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/scene.json caption"},
  {"text":"Belt-East checkpoint. Forty minutes' flight to Jupiter. Eleven days to the window.","translation":"‘동부 벨트’ 검문소. 목성까지 비행 사십 분. 창구까지는 열하루.","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/scene.json captions[0] text"},
  {"text":"They invented the warp drive. They couldn't get rid of form F-12 in triplicate.","translation":"워프 엔진은 발명했다. F-12 서식 3부 작성은 끝내 없애지 못했다.","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/scene.json captions[1] text"},
  {"text":"Gena filled it in twice. The third copy floated away.","translation":"게나는 두 번 작성했다. 세 번째 사본은 둥둥 떠 가 버렸다.","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/scene.json captions[2] text"},
  {"text":"Window 3 is open again.","translation":"3번 창구가 다시 열렸다.","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/script.js"},
  {"text":"Window 3 has closed for a technical break.","translation":"3번 창구가 기술 점검 휴식에 들어갔다.","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/script.js"},
  {"text":"A golden yacht with a flashing light went straight to the window, no queue. Your number has been recalculated.","translation":"경광등을 단 황금 요트가 줄도 서지 않고 곧장 창구로 갔다. 당신의 번호가 다시 계산되었다.","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/script.js"},
  {"text":"≈ {days} days","translation":"≈ {days}일","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/widgets/board.html"},
  {"text":"break","translation":"휴식","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/widgets/board.html"},
  {"text":"Electronic queue · window 3","translation":"전자 대기열 · 3번 창구","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/widgets/board.html"},
  {"text":"Now","translation":"지금","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/widgets/board.html"},
  {"text":"Your number","translation":"당신의 번호","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/widgets/board.html"},
